{"nodes": [{"id": "app_gim_issues", "label": "ISSUES.md (registro de problemas y riesgos)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_gim_issues_monto_cero", "label": "Issue: generar_pagos_pendientes crea PagoMensual con monto=0", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "No hay campo de tarifa en Alumno ni concepto de plan con precio; riesgo aceptado en Fase 1. Cerrado en Fase 2: ConfirmarPagoForm exige monto obligatorio antes de marcar PAGADO. El l\u00edmite de fondo (tarifa configurable) sigue abierto.", "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_gim_issues_free_tier_render", "label": "Issue: arranque en free tier de Render (Postgres expira a 90 d\u00edas, sin cron)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "El usuario solo tiene cuenta gratuita (Claude no puede cargar tarjetas de terceros). Aceptado: Postgres free expira a 90 d\u00edas, el web service se duerme, y no hay cron free \u2014 generar_pagos se corre a mano desde la Shell de Render hasta el upgrade, que llega cuando el primer gimnasio pague la se\u00f1a (Fase 6).", "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_gim_issues_input_css_collectstatic", "label": "Issue: input.css dentro de static/ romp\u00eda collectstatic", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "El post-procesador de WhiteNoise parsea todo .css recolectado e interpret\u00f3 el @import de Tailwind como archivo literal (MissingFileError). Se movi\u00f3 la fuente a styles/input.css, fuera de STATICFILES_DIRS; solo el output compilado static/css/app.css se recolecta.", "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_gim_issues_whitenoise_manifest_debug", "label": "Issue: manifest de WhiteNoise romp\u00eda {% static %} en dev/tests", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "CompressedManifestStaticFilesStorage exige un manifest que solo genera collectstatic (que no corre en dev/tests): 33 tests fallaron. El backend de staticfiles qued\u00f3 condicional a DEBUG \u2014 manifest solo con DEBUG=False.", "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_gim_issues_tailwind_apply_components", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n Fase 4: redefinir clases existentes con @apply en vez de reescribir templates", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Tailwind v4 permite redefinir clases de componente (@layer components); se redefinieron los MISMOS nombres (.tarjeta, .boton, .badge--ok, .tabla) que ya usaban las ~25 plantillas \u2014 ning\u00fan template cambi\u00f3 una clase, solo cambi\u00f3 lo que significa. Esto + hx-boost cancel\u00f3 el plan de 5 agentes paralelos: 90% del objetivo sin reescritura.", "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "app_gim_issues", "target": "app_gim_reuso", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_gim_roadmap_primero_se_cobra", "target": "app_gim_issues_free_tier_render", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_gim_issues", "target": "app_gim_issues_monto_cero", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ISSUES.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_gim_issues", "target": "app_gim_issues_free_tier_render", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_s